vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus packaging
===============================

The branch debian/trixie of https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus
holds the Debian packaging on top of the upstream tag v<version>. master
stays plain upstream source.

Build with git-buildpackage, the orig tarball is created from the tag:

  git clone https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus.git
  cd vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus
  git checkout debian/trixie
  gbp buildpackage

The package needs vdr-dev of the VDR it is built for. Ready-made packages
for Debian 13 (trixie) and VDR 2.8.3 are in the vdr-portal.de repository.

 -- Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>
